# Page layouts: how the panels are composed into each published figure. They are
# a decision of the manuscript, not of the analysis, so they stay local and out
# of the public repository -- but they stay on disk, next to the code that builds
# the panels. The canonical copies live in nov26_sin_Ecuador/final_version/.
make_fig*.R
make_fig*.py
*_layout.py
*_layout.R

